<p>Finish carpentry is the work people notice without knowing why: tight mitres, straight lines and trim that sits flat against the wall. It's the core of what we do. Owner Jonas Zanini spent 20 years in IT before turning to carpentry, and he brings the same attention to detail to every casing, baseboard and mantel. Zanini Renovations has been a fully insured carpentry business in Carleton Place since 2020. <a href="{{ url('/about') }}">More about Jonas</a>.</p>

